OL,3,GNEWSAOrangutan Nettie was a 'notorious
OL,4,Apeople-watcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sumatran orangutan who lived in
OL,7,Fvarious zoos during her life developed
OL,8,Fa love for people-watching, keepers
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FAnette, better known as Nettie, whose
OL,12,Ffinal home was Jersey Zoo, where she
OL,13,Flived for 15 years, was also known as
OL,14,Fbeing a "very soft mum" after she gave
OL,15,Fbirth to her baby Jantho in 2013.
OL,17,FJersey Zoo's director of operations
OL,18,FMark Habben said Nettie was a notorious
OL,19,Fpeople-watcher who was "was intrigued
OL,20,Fby all the comings and goings and, if
OL,21,Fanyone came into her enclosure, she
OL,22,Fobserved them all".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
