OL,3,GNEWSAOrangutan Nettie was a 'notorious
OL,4,Apeople-watcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHabben also revealed another soft side
OL,7,Fof the orangutan, who died earlier this
OL,8,Fmonth age 43: "She was a really good
OL,9,Fmum but probably a bit too soft."
